<title>PORTUGAL: Analysts comment on Portugal Telecom 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Analysts comment on Portugal Telecom 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are some quick reactions to news that Portugal Telecom boosted consolidated net profit by 51.5 percent in 1996 to 54.9 billion escudos.</p>
<p>JOAO PEREIRA, ESPIRITO SANTO RESEARCH</p>
<p>&quot;The results are inside some of the latest forecasts, but the first reaction for those who were expecting a little less will be to buy (the stock). There is room for it (the stock) to break 6,600 escudos. The most recent forecasts of international analysts pointed to around 55 billion escudos (of profit).</p>
<p>(PT shares closed at 6,545 escudos on Tuesday)</p>
